      "message": "I\u0027m honestly uncertain how to validate we continued with the current framework, without using states.\n\nSo possible testing AMSes: \n- PR swap: would need mock TC to interact with and observe we progressed to try power role swapping.  There are PS_RDY messages to observe later, but only after TC interactions.\n- VDM request: if message was sent and reply received, we fill in discovery info and return to ready.  So the observable result would be parsing our discovery information? \n- DR swap: would need mock TC layer to check new data role\n- Vconn swap: would need mock TC to change Vconn role in, with possible PS_RDY to check depending on roles we set up\n\nThe most straightforward one I can think of here would be the VDM request?  What are your thoughts?",
